From 441f94dd85ab1fd55ba5f515ebd9e44b9e7f3614 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0123: HUD editor matches the approved mockup (background, 5
 elements, compass/hints split) + launcher credit
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The launcher HUD editor preview now matches the approved HUD settings
mockup: the forest+Mario background per aspect (reused originals), the
coins/moons regrouping (coin+0896, hexagon+020 and the white bar are one
coins group; the two rows of dots are the moons group alone), compass and
the menu/map hints as two independent elements (5 total), and the thick
black rounded device frame around the preview. The launcher title gains
the credit line 'by 与荒野制作'.
Game side: DM_HUD_N 4->5 (new DM_HUD_HINTS), the state page moves the
masks to +0x240/+0x244 for the 15 floats, hud_edge matches PicIcon /
TxtTotalShine under Counter as coins and TxtGuide01 as hints, with a
parent-relative compensation so a child of a moved container does not
double-count its parent's transform. The white bar has no pane name in
any log and stays unmoved in-game (known limitation).
